@startuml
skinparam shadowing false

[*] --> PENDING_PAYMENT : guest books\n(rooms held for 15 min)
PENDING_PAYMENT --> CONFIRMED : payment succeeds
PENDING_PAYMENT --> EXPIRED : hold runs out (timer)
PENDING_PAYMENT --> CANCELLED : guest abandons
CONFIRMED --> CANCELLED : guest, host or admin cancels\n(refund by policy)
CONFIRMED --> COMPLETED : check-out date has passed (timer)
EXPIRED --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]
COMPLETED --> [*]

note right of PENDING_PAYMENT
  Counts against availability
  only until its hold expires
end note
note right of CONFIRMED
  Counts against availability
end note
@enduml